{"metadata":{"title":"Going further with more resources","category":"Orange Unified Design System","role":"project","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)"},"sections":[{"backgroundImage":"ic_theme_intro.png","title":"Going further with more resources","kind":"hero","image":"ic_theme_intro.png","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"chapter":"Go further with more ressources"},{"tasks":[{"stepsSection":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as libraries) with details about everything: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can get it at ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/"}]}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-1.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"icon finder","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects."}]}],"type":"step","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Go to the website and learn things at "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}],"media":"tu